00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,570
Reculez !

276
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:43,280
Kojiro Hyuga en tant que milieu de terrain, hein...

277
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:47,710
Grâce à sa maîtrise de ce tir lointain, le Tiger Shot,
